:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Copyright Quartz Systems 2026.
:HELP NAME=DSPF.Display File (DSPF)
:P.Use the Display File (DSPF) command to browse a stream file or a
database member, read only.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPF/STMF'.Stream file, or (STMF)
:P.The stream file, or for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.path-name:EPV.
:PD.Type a path name of up to 300 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPF/FILE'.Data base file (FILE)
:P.The file, by name and library.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPF/MBR'.Member (MBR)
:P.The member for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*FIRST:EPK.
:PD.The first one.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=EDTF.Edit File (EDTF)
:P.Use the Edit File (EDTF) command to edit a stream file or a database
member, CCSID-aware.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='EDTF/STMF'.Stream file, or (STMF)
:P.The stream file, or for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.path-name:EPV.
:PD.Type a path name of up to 300 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='EDTF/FILE'.Data base file (FILE)
:P.The file, by name and library.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='EDTF/MBR'.Member (MBR)
:P.The member for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*FIRST:EPK.
:PD.The first one.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
